*.pcblibdoc
*.schlibdoc
*.compiledpcbdoc
*.PcbDocPreview

# Altium cache and autosave
*.schdocpreview
*.Cache
*.tmpSchDocPreview
*.tmpPcbDocPreview
*.PcbDocPreview
*.SchDocPreview

# Simulation results
*.sdf
*.swc
*.cir
*.wav
*.raw
*.log

# Windows hidden files
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini



